# PROJECT: SOCIAL COMMAND CENTER
## Ultra-Detailed Full-Stack Development Specification

Build a premium, production-ready, cloud-based multi-platform social media publishing and account management application.

The application will allow users to connect multiple YouTube, TikTok, Facebook, and Instagram accounts, manage all accounts from one dashboard, upload one or multiple videos, provide all publishing information in one place, select target accounts, and publish content across multiple social media platforms with one click.

This must be a real, functional application, NOT a UI-only prototype.

Every button, form, navigation item, account connection, publishing action, setting, and dashboard feature must work.

Do not generate fake publishing success messages or simulated account connections.

---

# 1. CORE OBJECTIVE

The primary objective is to create one centralized social media publishing system.

Supported platforms:

1. YouTube
2. TikTok
3. Facebook
4. Instagram

Main workflow:

1. User opens the website.
2. User authenticates.
3. User connects any number of social media accounts.
4. User uploads one or multiple videos.
5. User enters all available video information in one centralized editor.
6. The application analyzes the information provided.
7. The application intelligently maps relevant information to each platform's publishing requirements.
8. User selects which accounts should receive the video.
9. All accounts should be selected by default.
10. User clicks PUBLISH.
11. The application starts publishing to all selected accounts.
12. Each platform has its own publishing status and progress.
13. Successful publishing results are saved in cloud history.

The application must support an unlimited number of connected accounts from the application-design perspective, subject to provider API quotas and account/platform restrictions.

